{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(<i>Currently in an Alpha Development. Join the Discord for early playtesting!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stun. Soar. Score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>The Pitch</strong>\u00a0</i>is a zero-gravity, momentum-based arena sport where two teams compete to pass, dash, and use teamwork to throw or slam the ball into the goal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/Faceoff_with_spin_move.gif?t=1747145074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With wall and player-based jumps, air dashes, and game-changing stuns, every moment is a fast, fluid test of reflexes and teamwork.\u00a0Tight controls and dynamic matchups make every play feel fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/Scoreboard_GIF.gif?t=1747145074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482770?t=1747145074","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482770?t=1747145074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/5690bb94700b2137e7abca68cf0a5363b60d9b2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747145074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/5690bb94700b2137e7abca68cf0a5363b60d9b2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747145074","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_desc